<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australia needs higher growth for jobs - Howard.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australia needs higher growth for jobs - Howard.</headline>
<dateline>CANBERRA 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian Prime Minister John Howard said on Thursday higher economic growth was needed to combat unemployment.</p>
<p>&quot;The first thing you have to do is to achieve over a sustained period of time a higher rate of economic growth than the rates we have at the present time, which are by world standards quite high,&quot; Howard told parliament.</p>
</text>
